From Stdlib Require Import List.
From proofs.experiments.issue624.rocq Require Import RegisterMachine.
Import ListNotations Complexity.Complexity Machines RegisterMachine.

(* The state-offset normalization used to join adjacent register blocks. *)
Goal forall off q blocks,
  shiftConfig off (home q blocks) = home (q+off) blocks.
Proof.
  intros. unfold home, shiftConfig.
  cbn [state tapeLeft tapeHead tapeRight]. Show.
  reflexivity.
Qed.
Print Assumptions compile_reaches.
Print Assumptions cost_polynomial.
